|epic=yes
|type=spell
|prereq=21st level, [[spell focus]] and [[greater spell focus]] in the chosen [[spell school|school]], ability to cast 9th level spells
|desc=The character gains a +6 to the [[difficulty class]] for all [[saving throw]]s against spells from the chosen school of magic.
|use=automatic
