==Notes==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* The "ability to cast level 9 spells" may be better understood as the ability to learn level 9 spells (as [[wizard]]s are not required to know spells of the highest level they can cast).
* ''Epic spell focus'' does not apply to spells that are granted as special abilities.
* ''Epic spell focus'' does not stack with [[spell focus]] or [[greater spell focus]]; it replaces the previous two feats' benefits.